{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/断雷闪","pageid":7995,"revid":19252,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%AD%E9%9B%B7%E9%97%AA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%AD%E9%9B%B7%E9%97%AA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%AD%E9%9B%B7%E9%97%AA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>断雷闪</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.96.AD.E9.9B.B7.E9.97.AA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"断雷闪\"><b>断雷闪</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 断雷闪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/7g8nt1z7l5xpzdpgdi2puc55nf2te9u.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%96%AD%E9%9B%B7%E9%97%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/7g8nt1z7l5xpzdpgdi2puc55nf2te9u.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%96%AD%E9%9B%B7%E9%97%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ec/7g8nt1z7l5xpzdpgdi2puc55nf2te9u.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />断雷闪\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3*3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"武技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">武技</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，冲锋至目标身进行攻击，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>伤害，再对正前方<font color=\"#ed7950\">3*3</font>区域所有敌人进行追击，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>范围伤害（不含[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">物品</font></span></span>]）；攻击前获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />\n✦攻击后，技能变更为：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">裂空连打</font></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />\n✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"金狮形态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">金狮形态</font></span></span>]时，若拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狮血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狮血</font></span></span>]则消耗并使攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3十字 3*3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/15/st949dxiu1f4jlv81a9895x0qrqnh6u.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A3.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/15/st949dxiu1f4jlv81a9895x0qrqnh6u.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A3.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/15/st949dxiu1f4jlv81a9895x0qrqnh6u.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A3.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"198\" data-file-height=\"199\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;wi